window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Would you sacrifice yourself for the world?</b></p> <p>Ara's found her soul mate and accepted the bond, but now she must journey south with her team, keeping her secret while fighting against the power that's threatening to destroy her and the world at every turn. Though fate is non-negotiable, can she find a way to escape it? Or will she have to do the unthinkable before she becomes the victim? The hunted?</p> <p>It's over for Temir. He's lost everything, including his freedom. His mate, who has refused him, has all the answers but can he escape the king and find a way to get that information from her? How can he save the world when he can't even save himself?</p> <p>It's time for war in Alewyn and fate has decided that no one is safe.</p> <p><b>One Savior. One Prisoner. One Epic Battle.</b></p>"; 
